+  search <pattern>    Search services by name pattern
+  summary             Show summary statistics of all services
+  version             Show version information
+  help                Show this help message
+
+Examples:
+  service-check list
+  service-check get sshd
+  service-check search docker
+  service-check summary
+
+Options:
+  --json              Output in JSON format (where applicable)
+  --timeout <dur>     Set timeout (default: 10s, e.g. 5s, 30s)
+
+%sExamples:%s
+  $ service-check list
+  $ service-check get nginx
+  $ service-check search cron
+  $ service-check summary
