+# unit-convert
+
+CLI tool to convert between units of measurement. Supports length, weight, temperature, volume, speed, area, data, time, angle, and pressure.
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/unit-convert@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/unit-convert.git
+cd unit-convert
+go build -o unit-convert .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+unit-convert <value> <from-unit> <to-unit>
+unit-convert <value> <from-unit> all     # convert to all units in category
+unit-convert --list [category]            # list available units
+```
+
+## Examples
+
+```bash
+# Temperature
+unit-convert 100 c f        # 100 c = 212 f
+unit-convert 0 c k          # 0 c = 273.15 k
+
+# Length
+unit-convert 5 km mi        # 5 km = 3.10686 mi
+unit-convert 1 mi km        # 1 mi = 1.60934 km
+
+# Weight
+unit-convert 1 kg lb        # 1 kg = 2.20462 lb
+unit-convert 10 lb kg       # 10 lb = 4.53592 kg
+
+# Speed
+unit-convert 60 mph kmh     # 60 mph = 96.5606 kmh
+
+# Volume
+unit-convert 1 gal l        # 1 gal = 3.78541 l
+unit-convert 500 ml oz      # 500 ml = 16.907 floz
+
+# Data
+unit-convert 1 gb mb        # 1 gb = 1000 mb
+unit-convert 1024 kiB miB   # 1024 kiB = 1 miB
+
+# Time
+unit-convert 1 h min        # 1 h = 60 min
+unit-convert 3600 s h       # 3600 s = 1 h
+
+# Convert to all units in category
+unit-convert 1 kg all
+unit-convert 100 c all
+
+# List available units
+unit-convert --list
+unit-convert --list length
+```
+
+## Supported Categories
+
+| Category | Units |
+|----------|-------|
+| length | m, mm, cm, km, in, ft, yd, mi, nm, um, ly, au |
+| weight | kg, g, mg, t, oz, lb, st, ug |
+| temperature | c (Celsius), f (Fahrenheit), k (Kelvin) |
+| volume | l, ml, m3, cm3, gal, qt, pt, cup, floz, tbsp, tsp |
+| speed | m/s, km/h, mph, knots, ft/s |
+| area | m2, km2, cm2, mm2, ha, acre, ft2, in2 |
+| data (SI) | B, KB, MB, GB, TB, PB, bit, kbit, mbit, gbit |
+| data (binary) | B, KiB, MiB, GiB, TiB, PiB |
+| time | s, ms, us, ns, min, h, d, w, mo, y |
