+
+| Command          | Description                          |
+|------------------|--------------------------------------|
+| `add`, `new`     | Add a new journal entry              |
+| `read`, `get`    | Read a specific entry by ID          |
+| `list`, `ls`     | List recent entries                  |
+| `search`         | Search entries by keyword            |
+| `tags`           | Show all tags with counts            |
+| `stats`          | Show journal statistics              |
+| `edit`           | Edit an existing entry               |
+| `delete`, `rm`   | Delete an entry                      |
+| `export`         | Export entries (markdown or JSON)    |
+| `help`           | Show help message                    |
+
+### Options
+
+| Flag              | Description                                  |
+|-------------------|----------------------------------------------|
+| `-t`, `--tags`    | Comma-separated tags (e.g., `"work,personal"`) |
