+# flashcards-cli
+
+Spaced repetition flashcard system for the terminal. Uses the SM-2 algorithm for optimal review scheduling.
+
+## Features
+
+- Create decks and add flashcards with front/back content
+- SM-2 spaced repetition algorithm for optimal learning
+- Interactive study sessions with recall rating (0-5 scale)
+- CSV import for bulk card creation
+- JSON export for backup and sharing
+- Progress statistics and due card tracking
+- SQLite persistence (no server required)
+- Single binary, zero dependencies at runtime
+
+## Installation
+
+### From source
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/flashcards-cli@latest
+```
+
+### Build manually
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/flashcards-cli.git
+cd flashcards-cli
+go build -o flashcards-cli .
+sudo cp flashcards-cli /usr/local/bin/
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+flashcards-cli <command> [arguments]
+```
+
+### Deck management
+
+| Command | Description |
+|---|---|
+| `deck add <name> [-d "description"]` | Add a new deck |
+| `deck list` | List all decks |
+| `deck rm <id>` | Remove a deck |
+
+### Card management
+
+| Command | Description |
+|---|---|
+| `card add <deck_id> <front> <back>` | Add a card to a deck |
+| `card list <deck_id>` | List cards in a deck |
+| `card rm <deck_id> <card_id>` | Remove a card |
+
+### Study
+
+| Command | Description |
+|---|---|
+| `study <deck_id> [--limit N]` | Study due cards from a deck |
+| `study all [--limit N]` | Study due cards from all decks |
+
+### Stats & I/O
+
+| Command | Description |
+|---|---|
+| `stats` | Show overall statistics |
+| `stats deck <deck_id>` | Show deck statistics |
+| `import csv <file> <deck_id>` | Import cards from CSV |
+| `export json [deck_id]` | Export cards as JSON |
+
+### Examples
+
+```bash
+# Create a vocabulary deck
+flashcards-cli deck add "Spanish Vocabulary"
+
+# Add cards
+flashcards-cli card add 1 "hola" "hello"
