 ## Features
 
-- **Add transactions** — income and expenses with categories and descriptions
-- **Category budgets** — set monthly limits per category with overspend warnings
-- **Monthly reports** — visual breakdown of income and expenses by category
-- **Filtering** — filter transactions by month and category
-- **Import/export** — bulk import from JSON, export for backup
-- **Persistent storage** — data saved to `~/.budget-cli/budget.json`
+- **Categories**: Create income and expense categories with optional monthly budgets
+- **Transactions**: Log daily transactions linked to categories
+- **Budget summary**: See spending vs budget per category with usage percentages
+- **Export**: Export transactions as JSON for further processing
+- **SQLite storage**: All data stored locally in a SQLite database
 
 ## Install
 
