+# log-stream
+
+Aggregate and stream logs from multiple file sources via HTTP API with SSE (Server-Sent Events) support.
+
+Tail multiple log files simultaneously, filter by level/source/pattern, and stream results in real-time to clients via Server-Sent Events or retrieve buffered entries via REST.
+
+## Features
+
+- Add/remove log file sources via API
+- Real-time streaming via Server-Sent Events (SSE)
+- Filter by log level, source name, or regex pattern
+- REST endpoint for buffered historical entries
+- Automatic level detection (ERROR, WARN, DEBUG, INFO)
+- Config persistence for surviving restarts
+- Resilient file tailing with auto-reconnect
+
+## API Endpoints
+
+### Sources
+
+| Method | Path | Description |
+|--------|------|-------------|
+| GET | `/api/sources` | List all log sources |
+| POST | `/api/sources` | Add a log file source |
+| DELETE | `/api/sources/{id}` | Remove a log source |
+
+### Logs
+
+| Method | Path | Description |
+|--------|------|-------------|
+| GET | `/api/entries?level=ERROR&source=app&pattern=foo` | Get buffered log entries |
+| GET | `/api/stream?level=ERROR&source=app&pattern=foo` | Stream logs via SSE |
+
+### System
+
+| Method | Path | Description |
+|--------|------|-------------|
+| GET | `/health` | Health check |
+
+## Quick Start
+
+```bash
+# Run with Docker
+docker run -d -p 8080:8080 \
+  -v /var/log:/logs:ro \
+  --name log-stream tatanesan/log-stream
+
+# Or build from source
+go build -o log-stream .
+./log-stream --port 8080
+```
+
+Server starts on `http://localhost:8080`.
+
+## Usage Examples
+
+### Add a log source
+
+```bash
+curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/sources \
+  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
+  -d '{
+    "name": "nginx-access",
+    "path": "/var/log/nginx/access.log"
+  }'
+```
+
+### Add a source with regex filter
+
+```bash
+curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/sources \
+  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
+  -d '{
+    "name": "app-errors",
+    "path": "/var/log/myapp.log",
+    "pattern": "ERROR|FATAL"
+  }'
+```
