+# cli-calendar
+
+A personal CLI agenda with reminders, categories, and calendar views.
+
+## Features
+
+- Monthly calendar view with event markers
+- Weekly and daily event views
+- Event management (add, edit, remove)
+- Search events by title/description
+- Reminder system with time-based alerts
+- Categories for organizing events
+- JSON/CSV export and import
+- SQLite-based persistence
+
+## Installation
+
+### From source
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/cli-calendar@latest
+```
+
+Or clone and build:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/cli-calendar.git
+cd cli-calendar
+go build -o cli-calendar .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+cli-calendar <command> [arguments]
+```
+
+### Commands
+
+| Command | Description |
+|---------|-------------|
+| `month [-y year] [-m month]` | Display calendar month view |
+| `today` | Show today's events |
+| `week` | Show current week view |
+| `list [-s start] [-e end]` | List events in date range |
+| `add "title" -d date [-t time] [-r reminder] [-c category]` | Add a new event |
+| `remove <id>` | Remove an event |
