+# cli-wishlist
+
+Wishlist manager with priorities and links. Store, search, and export your wish list from the terminal.
+
+## Features
+
+- Add items with name, link, priority (low/medium/high), and notes
+- List items filtered by priority or sorted by priority/date/name
+- Search items by name or notes
+- Update any field of an existing item
+- Remove items by ID
+- Export wishlist as JSON
+- View statistics (total items, breakdown by priority)
+- SQLite persistence in `~/.cli-wishlist/wishlist.db`
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/cli-wishlist@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/cli-wishlist.git
+cd cli-wishlist
+go build -o cli-wishlist .
+sudo mv cli-wishlist /usr/local/bin/
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+cli-wishlist add <name> [--link URL] [--priority low|medium|high] [--notes "text"]
+cli-wishlist list [--filter low|medium|high] [--sort priority|date|name]
+cli-wishlist remove <id>
+cli-wishlist update <id> <field> <value>
+cli-wishlist search <query>
+cli-wishlist stats
+cli-wishlist export [--json]
+```
+
+## Examples
+
+```bash
+# Add items
+cli-wishlist add "Mechanical Keyboard" --link https://example.com/kb --priority high
+cli-wishlist add "Book: Clean Code" --priority medium --notes "recommended by team"
+cli-wishlist add "Standing Desk" --priority low
+
+# List all (sorted by priority by default)
+cli-wishlist list
+
+# Filter by priority
+cli-wishlist list --filter high
+
+# Sort by date
+cli-wishlist list --sort date
+
+# Search
+cli-wishlist search keyboard
+
+# Update priority
+cli-wishlist update 3 priority high
+
+# Remove
+cli-wishlist remove 1
+
+# Stats
+cli-wishlist stats
+
+# Export as JSON
+cli-wishlist export --json
+```
+
+## Docker
+
+```bash
